---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我 — APPLEpig's Blog" description="关于 APPLEpig (msmlwdzh) 的个人介绍">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">关于我</h1>
    <div class="text-gray-300 space-y-6">
      <div class="glass p-6 flex items-center gap-6">
        <img
          src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221705216?v=4"
          alt="APPLEpig"
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full border-2 border-accent"
        />
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">APPLEpig</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400">GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/msmlwdzh" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-alt transition-smooth" target="_blank" rel="noopener">msmlwdzh</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-400">📍 中国</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        你好！我是 <span class="text-accent">APPLEpig</span>，一名来自中国的开发者。
        我对技术充满热情，喜欢探索前沿的开发技术和工具。
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text pt-4">技术栈</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm border border-accent/50 text-accent">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm border border-accent/50 text-accent">SCSS</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm border border-accent/50 text-accent">Astro</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm border border-accent/50 text-accent">Tailwind CSS</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm border border-accent/50 text-accent">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm border border-accent/50 text-accent">Node.js</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text pt-4">项目</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <a href="https://github.com/msmlwdzh/msmlwdzh.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           class="glass p-4 block hover:border-accent/50 transition-smooth">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-accent">msmlwdzh.github.io</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">个人 GitHub Pages 站点 · SCSS</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/msmlwdzh/checkin" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           class="glass p-4 block hover:border-accent/50 transition-smooth">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-accent">checkin</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">签到项目 · JavaScript</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text pt-4">关于这个博客</h2>
      <p>
        本博客使用 <span class="text-accent">Astro</span> 构建并搭配
        <span class="text-accent">Tailwind CSS v4</span> 样式，设计语言源自 Framer Design System。
      </p>
      <p>
        视觉风格以深色模式为核心，采用玻璃拟态（Glassmorphism）表面、冰蓝色点缀和流畅的弹性动效——
        精炼的极简主义，让内容成为主角。
      </p>
      <p>
        内容采用 Markdown 文件驱动，通过 Git 版本控制，构建时编译为纯静态 HTML，默认零 JavaScript 输出。
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4">
        <a href="https://github.com/msmlwdzh" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent hover:text-accent-alt transition-smooth">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
          在 GitHub 上找到我
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
